The program begins by initializing an array of integers `arr`. It then creates an empty HashSet called `uniqueSet`. The program iterates over each element in the `arr` array and adds it to the HashSet using the `Add()` method. Since HashSet does not allow duplicate values, any duplicates are automatically removed. Finally, the program prints out the elements of the HashSet using a `foreach` loop.

