constructor(private store: Store) {}

this.store.select(selectJwtToken).subscribe(token => {
  // Do something with the token
});
```
Proponents of state management libraries highlight their utility in managing complex application states, while others caution about the added complexity they may introduce.

Each method has its own advantages and potential drawbacks, and the choice may depend on specific application needs and security considerations.

